Subject: [PATCH 0805/3799] soh: rename func_80B9D054 -> ObjRoomtimer_Start

Name source: DEDUCED from the code (confidence HIGH) -- zeldaret/oot
leaves this symbol address-named too, so there is no upstream name to adopt.
Reason: starts the room timer from the actor params (0x3FF meaning none), demotes the actor to ACTORCAT_PROP, and moves to the waiting action.
Defined in soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Obj_Roomtimer/z_obj_roomtimer.c.

Tagged [LLM:HIGH] at the definition, every declaration and every call site, so a
reader meeting the name anywhere knows it is inferred.
---
 .../overlays/actors/ovl_Obj_Roomtimer/z_obj_roomtimer.c    | 7 ++++---
 1 file changed, 4 insertions(+), 3 deletions(-)

diff --git a/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Obj_Roomtimer/z_obj_roomtimer.c b/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Obj_Roomtimer/z_obj_roomtimer.c
index 5f68d1767..27ab257b6 100644
--- a/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Obj_Roomtimer/z_obj_roomtimer.c
+++ b/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Obj_Roomtimer/z_obj_roomtimer.c
@@ -12,7 +12,8 @@ void ObjRoomtimer_Init(Actor* thisx, PlayState* play);
 void ObjRoomtimer_Destroy(Actor* thisx, PlayState* play);
 void ObjRoomtimer_Update(Actor* thisx, PlayState* play);
 
-void func_80B9D054(ObjRoomtimer* this, PlayState* play);
+// LLM generated name (HIGH), was func_80B9D054: starts the room timer from the actor params (0x3FF meaning none), demotes the actor to ACTORCAT_PROP, and moves to the waiting action.
+void ObjRoomtimer_Start(ObjRoomtimer* this, PlayState* play);  // was func_80B9D054 [LLM:HIGH]
 void func_80B9D0B0(ObjRoomtimer* this, PlayState* play);
 
 const ActorInit Obj_Roomtimer_InitVars = {
@@ -44,7 +45,7 @@ void ObjRoomtimer_Init(Actor* thisx, PlayState* play) {
         }
     }
 
-    this->actionFunc = func_80B9D054;
+    this->actionFunc = ObjRoomtimer_Start;  // was func_80B9D054 [LLM:HIGH]
 }
 
 void ObjRoomtimer_Destroy(Actor* thisx, PlayState* play) {
@@ -55,7 +56,7 @@ void ObjRoomtimer_Destroy(Actor* thisx, PlayState* play) {
     }
 }
 
-void func_80B9D054(ObjRoomtimer* this, PlayState* play) {
+void ObjRoomtimer_Start(ObjRoomtimer* this, PlayState* play) {
     if (this->actor.params != 0x3FF) {
         Interface_SetTimer(this->actor.params);
     }
